    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "textbook-definition",
        "moduleId": "byte-and-address",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "字节：存储的基本单位",
        "markdown": "在内存和硬盘中，数据存储的基本单位是**字节（Byte）**。硬件用二进制位表示数据，每一位是一个**比特（Bit）**；一个字节由连续的 8 个比特组成，因此也可以看作一个 8 位二进制数，或一个 2 位十六进制数。1 字节记作 1B，1 比特记作 1b；在汇编语言里，大多数情况下需要处理的最小单位就是字节。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000013"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "硬件基础",
                "存储单元"
              ],
              "lineStart": 346,
              "lineEnd": 371,
              "assetRefs": [
                "./assets/3-endianness.png"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "1b787e01afa788e4e39628714da0a6c23423660ecd5e908aefdf2646dafe4d18"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-intuition",
        "moduleId": "byte-and-address",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "把内存想成一排编号信箱",
        "markdown": "可以把内存想成一排从 0 开始编号的信箱：每个信箱恰好放一个字节，信箱上的编号就是**地址**，而信箱里的信才是数据。相邻信箱的编号相邻，但信箱里存什么与编号本身无关。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-capacity-units",
        "moduleId": "capacity-units",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "两套容量单位",
        "markdown": "常用容量单位有两套写法：KB、MB、GB 按十进制换算，1KB = 1000B、1MB = 1000KB、1GB = 1000MB；KiB、MiB、GiB 按二进制换算，1KiB = 1024B、1MiB = 1024KiB、1GiB = 1024MiB。macOS 和 iOS 采用十进制这套标准记法。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
